## Evidence and change

- Added two direct pinned Java heartbeat DTO inputs: repeated terminal
  U+001A markers, and repeated markers separated by JSON whitespace.
  Fastjson accepts both.
- The expanded Rust differential failed before the fix on both cases with
  `trailing characters`; the old normalizer removed only one final marker.
- The shared normalizer now removes U+001A markers from the trailing
  whitespace/marker suffix. Existing Java/Rust cases continue to reject
  markers in root-prefix and structural positions; raw controls inside JSON
  strings remain supported.
- Heartbeat DTO input corpus: 1,086 -> 1,088 cases.

